## Original Content
Cette propriété se trouve à l’un des accès de la base navale de Muskö, située à une soixantaine de kilomètres au sud de Stockholm, a indiqué l’armée dans un communiqué.

## Summary
Sweden is seeking to expropriate a property near the Muskö naval base that is owned by a businessman linked to Vladimir Putin. The Swedish army has indicated security concerns due to the property's proximity to the base.

## Key Points
- Sweden plans to expropriate the property.
- The property is linked to a businessman associated with Putin.
- It is located near the Muskö naval base, approximately 60 km south of Stockholm.
- The Swedish army has stated this in a communiqué, highlighting security implications.


